  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: ssl.get_server_certificate() did not check the\n     certificate hostname when ca_certs was given\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-19552.patch: enable check_hostname and pass\n       the host as server_hostname when ca_certs is given in Lib/ssl.py,\n       add regression test\n     - CVE-2026-19552\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: tarfile tar_filter bypass via link members replacing\n     the destination directory\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-114583.patch: reject hard and symbolic link\n       members whose name refers to the destination directory in both the\n       tar and data filters in Lib/tarfile.py, add regression test\n     - CVE-2026-114583",
